  <!-- Work Order tools (CNC.Controls.CustomTool.cs) - the factory-default bit set. Ids 0-13 match the
       retired OddJobsTool enum's own ordinals exactly, so a work order saved before this section existed
       still resolves to the same tool. Absent from an existing user App.config, this whole section is
       promoted in automatically (ConfigStore.ReadDocument's template-fallback path) the first time that
       user's build reads it; an operator can then rename/retune/delete any entry freely from Settings:App >
       Work Order - there is no protected/read-only tier. -->
  <section key="CustomTools">
    <CustomToolList>
